  '\n请帮我创建一个 DSH 技能，直接落盘，不要只给示例。\n\n要求：\n1. 用你的 write 工具创建文件：{0}/<技能名>/SKILL.md\n2. <技能名> 必须匹配 ^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)\$（小写字母/数字/连字符），这是 DSH 的技能名规范。\n3. 文件内容严格是下面这个格式（frontmatter 只有 name 与 description）：\n---\nname: <技能名>\ndescription: "<一句话说明什么时候该用这个技能>"\n---\n\n<技能正文：可执行的步骤、注意事项、输出格式；Markdown>\n4. 技能主题由你根据下面的描述来定，正文要具体到能照着做，不要写空话。\n5. 写完后告诉我：技能名、文件绝对路径、以及一句话说明它解决什么问题。\n\n我想让这个技能做的事：\n（在这里把你的需求写清楚，例如：把每天的聊天记录整理成一份 Markdown 日报，带待办清单）\n': '\nPlease create a DSH skill for me and write it straight to disk — don\'t just show me an example.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Use your write tool to create the file: {0}/<skill-name>/SKILL.md\n2. <skill-name> must match ^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)\\\$ (lowercase letters/digits/hyphens) — that\'s the DSH skill naming rule.\n3. The file content must be exactly this format (frontmatter has only name and description):\n---\nname: <skill-name>\ndescription: "<one sentence on when to use this skill>"\n---\n\n<skill body: actionable steps, caveats, output format; Markdown>\n4. You pick the skill topic from the description below; the body must be concrete enough to follow step by step — no fluff.\n5. When you\'re done, tell me: the skill name, the file\'s absolute path, and one sentence on what problem it solves.\n\nWhat I want this skill to do:\n(Write your needs clearly here, e.g.: turn each day\'s chat logs into a Markdown daily report with a to-do list)\n',
