  '⚠️ 三点如实说明：\n· 搜索请求会发到 **api.anysearch.com**（这是联网功能，不是本机算的）。\n· 它**在建会话那一刻**挂上去 —— 改完之后要**开一个新会话**才生效，老会话不变。\n· 匿名层限流较低：搜得太频繁会被限，等一会儿或填一把 Key。': '⚠️ Three honest notes:\n· Search requests go to **api.anysearch.com** (this is an online feature, not something computed on your phone).\n· It is attached **when a session is created** — changes apply to a **new session**; existing sessions keep what they had.\n· The anonymous tier is rate-limited: search too often and you get throttled — wait a bit, or paste a Key.',
  '⚠️ 两点如实说明：\n· 多一层子 agent = **多一份 token 与时间**（子会话也要跑模型），用免费那条小模型通道时尤其明显。\n· 改完**只在下一个会话生效**（会话进程启动时才读这份配置）。': '⚠️ Two honest notes:\n· One extra sub-agent layer means **extra tokens and time** (the child runs the model too) — especially noticeable on the free small-model lane.\n· Changes apply to the **next session** (the session process reads this config when it starts).',
  '⚠️ 先说清它能做什么、不能做什么：\n· 匿名层**只有一个 20B 级的模型**（`openai-fast`）：聊天、用工具都行，但**不是聪明模型** —— 写小说、长文、画布这类重活它接不住，那些请用自己的模型。\n· 有速率限制（人多了会慢或被限），失败了再试一次即可。\n· 上游是社区项目，**随时可能变**；真变了他会如实报错，不会假装成功。\n· 用不到时把开关关掉即可，你自己的模型配置一点都不会动。': '⚠️ What it can and cannot do:\n· The anonymous tier has **only one 20B-class model** (`openai-fast`): fine for chat and tool use, but it is **not a smart model** — novels, long documents and canvas work are beyond it; use your own model for those.\n· There is a rate limit (it gets slow or refused when busy); just retry.\n· Upstream is a community project and **may change at any time**; when it does, it reports the failure honestly instead of pretending to work.\n· Turn the switch off when you do not need it — none of your own model settings are touched.',
  '⚠️ 只提示、不替你判断：去掉**别人版权作品**上的水印有侵权风险（尤其发布或商用时）。': '⚠️ Just a heads-up, your call: removing watermarks from **someone else\'s copyrighted work** risks infringement (especially if you publish or sell it).',
  '⚠️ 本页不显示这 5 项的实时状态：Android 只在系统页面里读 / 改它们（要在这里显示，得再加一个原生查询接口，这一版没做）。是否已开启，以系统页面里的开关为准。': '⚠️ This page does not show the live state of these 5: Android only reads/changes them inside the system pages (showing them here would need another native query API, which this build does not have). Check the switch in the system page for the real state.',
  '⚠️ 请先看清楚：\n· 上游的免费额度**只给它自家客户端用**，这条通道是把请求**伪装成官方 CLI** 去通过它的限制 —— 属于灰色用法，**随时可能失效**（自 2026-09-16 起已收紧 6 次：换过端点、加过会话头、工具指纹从两个涨到四个）。\n· **它不需要任何 Key**：那条通道本来就是匿名的（上游凭据就是公开的 `public`），所以你不用在这里填任何东西；失效时它会如实报错，不会假装成功。\n· 它按出口 IP 限流，被限流时等一会儿再试。\n· 本 App **不做** IP 轮换、也不做反复重试（不拿它去刷额度）。\n· 用不到时请把它关掉。': '⚠️ Read this first:\n· The upstream free quota is **for its own client only**; this channel gets through by **disguising requests as the official CLI** — a grey-area use that **can break at any time** (six gate changes since 2026-09-16: the endpoint moved, session headers were added, the tool fingerprint grew from two to four).\n· **It needs no key**: that lane is anonymous (the upstream credential is the public word `public`), so there is nothing to fill in here; when it fails it says so honestly and never fakes success.\n· It rate-limits by egress IP; if you get throttled, wait a while.\n· This app does **not** rotate IPs and does **not** retry in a loop (we do not farm the quota).\n· Turn it off when you do not need it.',
  '⚠️ 请求形状按各家的文档写（端点、参数名、轮询都不一样）—— **能不能通要试**；失败会把上游原话显示出来。': '⚠️ Request shapes follow each vendor\'s docs (endpoints, parameter names and polling all differ) — **whether it works has to be tried**; failures show the upstream\'s own wording.',
  '⚠️ 边界（别踩）：图像与视频都**按厂家的形状**发 —— 端点、参数名、轮询各不相同（唯一来源是 assets/toolbox/media-vendors.mjs）。本机没有这些厂家的 Key、也没法真机验证，所以**能不能通要试**；失败了会把上游原话显示出来，不假装成功。': '⚠️ Limits: both image and video are sent in **each vendor\'s own shape** — endpoints, parameter names and polling all differ (the single source is assets/toolbox/media-vendors.mjs). This machine has no keys for these vendors and cannot be verified on a real device, so **whether it works has to be tried**; failures show the upstream\'s own wording instead of pretending to work.',
  '⚠️ 这个模型的对话模板可能与 DSH 不兼容（启动自检没通过）：发消息很可能直接失败。请到「设置 → 运行日志」导出后发回，我会按真实报错改。': '⚠️ The chat template of this model may be incompatible with DSH (startup self-check failed): sending a message will likely fail outright. Please export 「Settings → Runtime log」 and send it back — I will fix it based on the real error.',
  '✗ 名字不合法。{0}': '✗ Invalid name. {0}',
  '　「自定义」是占位：还没做，点了会如实说明，不会把主题切到一个不存在的状态。': '　"Custom" is a placeholder: it isn\'t built yet, and tapping it says so honestly instead of switching the theme to a state that doesn\'t exist.',
  '　当前语言：{0}（{1}）': '　Current language: {0} ({1})',
  '「{0}」已经在池子「{1}」里了。': '"{0}" is already in the pool "{1}".',
  '「{0}」已经登记，但名下一条模型都没有 —— 现在选中它没有任何模型可用。\n去「设置 → 模型 → 我的模型」点开这家：{1}点「测试并保存」（它会自动把模型登记进来），或点「获取模型」自己勾几个。': '"{0}" is registered but has no models under it — selecting it now gives you nothing to use.\nGo to Settings → Models → My models and open this provider: {1}tap "Test and save" (it registers the models for you), or tap "Fetch models" and tick a few yourself.',
