  '「作品」里还没有图片 —— 先生成一张，或用上面的按钮选一张。': '"Works" has no images yet — generate one first, or use the button above to pick one.',
  '「免费模型（无需 Key）」这条通道被上游关掉了（不是你没配 Key —— 它本来就不用 Key）。\n下一步：去「设置 → 模型」换一个自己配了 Key 的模型；这条通道以后再恢复就能继续用。': 'The "Free models (no Key needed)" lane has been shut off by the upstream (it is not that your Key is missing — this lane never needed one).\nNext: go to Settings → Models and switch to a model you have configured a Key for; the lane will keep working again if it comes back.',
  '「推理后端」和「上下文长度」会记住：下次进这一页、下次启动本地服务都以它为准。': '"Inference backend" and "context length" are remembered: they apply the next time you open this page and the next time you start the local service.',
  '一': 'One',
  '一个 Key 即可用 DeepSeek / MiMo / LongCat / GLM / Qwen / Claude / GPT 等全部模型。': 'One Key gets you every model — DeepSeek / MiMo / LongCat / GLM / Qwen / Claude / GPT and more.',
  '一句话或一张参考图，生成图片': 'One line of text or a reference image → a picture',
