  '一行一个镜头。例如：\n深夜的办公室只剩一盏灯\n他盯着屏幕上的数字，笑了一下\n门开了，站着他的老板': 'One line per shot. For example:\nThe office is dark at midnight but for one lamp\nHe stares at the numbers on screen and smiles\nThe door opens — his boss is standing there',
