  '下载在**本机**做，断了能接着下；装之前会**验两样** —— 文件哈希（没下坏）+ 签名（跟现在这个 App 是同一把钥匙签的）。签名对不上就不给你装，这是防止包被替换的那道闸。': 'The download happens **on this device**, and it can resume if it breaks. Before installing, two things are checked: the file checksum (nothing got corrupted) and the signature (signed with the same key as this app). If the signature does not match, it will not be installed — that is the gate that stops a swapped package.',
