  '同一份模型文件，区别只是"谁来算"：仅 CPU = 手机 CPU 算，慢但几乎所有手机都能跑；Vulkan = 交给手机 GPU 算，通常快 2–5 倍、更省电，需要 Android 9 以上。切换后端要重启服务。同一个模型两个后端各测一次，就能直接比出哪个快。': 'Same model file — the only difference is who computes: CPU only = the phone\'s CPU, slower but works on almost any phone; Vulkan = the phone\'s GPU, usually 2–5× faster and more power-efficient, requires Android 9 or later. Switching backends requires restarting the service. Benchmark the same model on both backends to see which is faster.',
  '后台运行依赖一个常驻通知把 App 留在后台。部分手机（尤其是国产 ROM 的省电策略）仍会杀掉进程，建议到系统设置里关闭本 App 的电池优化。App 被彻底杀掉期间不会触发，恢复后会把错过的记录标成「已错过」。': 'Background running relies on a persistent notification to keep the app alive. Some phones (especially the power-saving policies of Chinese ROMs) still kill the process; consider turning off battery optimisation for this app in system settings. Runs don\'t fire while the app is fully killed — after it comes back, missed runs are marked "missed".',
