  '多模态模型下完可以对话，但图片还发不进模型：App 目前只发纯文本。引擎其实已经带了看图能力，只差"启动时指一下视觉编码器"和"把图片发出去"这两处接线，后面版本补。': 'Once downloaded, a multimodal model can chat, but images cannot reach it yet: the App currently sends plain text only. The engine already has the vision capability — it just needs two wires: pointing it at the vision encoder at launch, and sending images through. Coming in a later version.',
