  '对方的目标：听出他**真正**的问题，并在节目结束前让他自己说出来。如果时间到了他还没说出口，就按"这一夜没能留住他"收尾，不要硬圆。': 'Their goal: hear what his **real** problem is, and get him to say it himself before the show ends. If time runs out and he hasn\'t, close on "that night couldn\'t hold on to him" — don\'t force a tidy ending.',
  '对方的目标：在 8 轮之内判断你到底有没有在说谎，然后说「我知道了」。到那一刻你必须给出真相（或者揭穿他的误判），然后这局结束。': 'Their goal: decide within 8 rounds whether you are lying, then say "I see." At that moment you must give the truth (or expose the wrong call), and the round ends.',
  '对方的目标：在氧气耗尽前做完三个决定（先修哪条线、要不要丢一个货舱、要不要叫醒同伴）。三个都定了这局就结束，你按结果给一个明确的结局。': 'Their goal: make three decisions before the oxygen runs out (which line to fix first, whether to drop a cargo bay, whether to wake the others). Once all three are settled the round ends, and you give a definite ending based on the outcome.',
