  '打开后，**会话里的 AI 会自己去查资料**（用户 2026-10-15 选定的方案 B）：App 在建会话时给运行时挂一个 `AnySearch` 的 MCP 服务器，模型于是能搜网页、并把来源链接写进回答。\n\n**不用填 Key 也能搜** —— 匿名层就能用（只是限流低）；想要更稳的额度，可以用邮箱在 [anysearch.com](https://anysearch.com) 换一把免费 Key（可选，填在下面）。': 'When on, **the AI inside your sessions looks things up on its own** (plan B, chosen 2026-10-15): the app mounts an `AnySearch` MCP server to the runtime when a session is created, so the model can search the web and cite source links in its answer.\n\n**No Key is required to search** — the anonymous tier works out of the box (just a lower rate limit). For a steadier quota you can get a free Key with your email at [anysearch.com](https://anysearch.com) (optional, paste it below).',
  '打开后，**会话里的 AI 可以"分人做事"**：把一块子任务交给另一个 agent 实例（**它有自己的上下文窗口**），干完只把结论拿回来 —— 主会话因此不会被中间过程撑爆，也能并行推进几件事。': 'When on, **the AI inside a session can split the work between people**: it hands a piece of the job to another agent instance (**with its own context window**) and only takes the conclusion back — so the main session does not drown in intermediate steps, and several things can proceed in parallel.',
  '打开后，App 会在本机起一个小小的**转发代理**，把请求按**官方 CLI 的样子**发到 OpenCode 的匿名免费额度，并把拿到的免费模型直接加进你的模型列表 —— **不用配置任何 Key**。\n\n⚠️ 只是想"不用 Key 就能聊"的话，**用上面那条（免 Key 免费模型）就好** —— 这条 Zen 通道自 2026-09-16 起被上游改过 6 次门禁，时好时坏（2026-10-16 本机实测又能用了，但它随时可能再变）；想知道此刻通不通，点下面的「通道自检」。': 'Once on, the app starts a tiny **forwarding proxy** on your device, sends requests to OpenCode\'s anonymous free quota **in the shape of its official CLI**, and adds the free models it finds straight to your model list — **no key to configure**.\n\n⚠️ If all you want is “chat without a key”, **the entry above (free models, no key) is the one to use** — this Zen channel has had six gate changes from the upstream since 2026-09-16 and comes and goes (it measured working again on 2026-10-16, but it can change again at any time); to see whether it works right now, tap “Channel self-check” below.',
