  '把**一本小说**改编成**一个能在浏览器里玩的游戏**。它不是"AI 自己玩"，也不是"AI 对战" —— 是一套有原著依据的改编流程：每一步都要引原文，最后要拿运行证据说话。': 'It turns **a novel** into **a game you can play in the browser**. It is not "AI playing by itself" and not "AI versus AI" — it is an adaptation workflow grounded in the source text: every step cites the original, and it ends with runtime evidence.',
  '把**每行一句话**当成一个镜头，拼成一条短剧：每镜一句配音、一张画面、一行字幕。想要每镜不同画面就打开下面那个开关（会用生图按该行文本画一张）。': 'Each **line is one shot**: one voice line, one image, one subtitle line per shot, composed into a short drama. Turn on the switch below if you want a different image per shot (it generates one from that line\'s text).',
  '把一本小说改编成能在浏览器里玩的游戏（七个阶段）': 'Turn a novel into a game you can play in the browser (7 stages)',
  '把一段**文稿**变成一条带配音和字幕的视频：自动分段 → 每段配音 → 字幕画在画面上 → 合成。适合口播、解说、知识分享。': 'Turn a **script** into a video with voice-over and subtitles: auto-split → voice each part → draw subtitles on the image → compose. Good for voice-over, commentary and explainers.',
