  '本': 'items',
  '本 App 随包包含以下第三方组件：\n\n· ffmpeg 7.1（含 libx264）—— 用于口播/短剧的拼接、转码、混音、加字幕。以 GPLv2 或更高版本（GPLv2+）授权，因为启用了 libx264（GPL）。\n  许可全文：https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\n  相应源码：https://ffmpeg.org/download.html 与 https://code.videolan.org/videolan/x264\n  本 App 未修改其源码，只做了针对 Android arm64 的编译（构建参数随仓库的 install/build-ffmpeg-android.sh 一并提供）。\n\n· frontend-design 与 discernment-nudge —— 两个随包「技能」（写给模型看的流程说明），搬自 Anthropic 官方开源技能库（github.com/anthropics/skills），以 Apache-2.0 授权。\n  本 App 已修改其文字：翻译成中文，并针对手机端的执行环境改写（本机没有 python；原版里"截图回看"这类做不到的步骤已删掉）。\n  许可全文随包提供：assets/skills/frontend-design/LICENSE.txt 与 assets/skills/discernment-nudge/LICENSE.txt\n  许可全文链接：https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n\n· novel-to-game / novel-game-analyze / game-concept / game-world-design / game-art-direction / game-build / game-qa（七个随包技能）—— 来自 NovelToGame v0.4.0（zenstory.ai 的「有原著依据的小说改编游戏工作流」），以 MIT 授权。\n  本 App 只改写了两处：技能简介改写成一行中文、正文开头加署名区块；正文与参考文件一字未改。\n  许可全文随包提供：assets/skills/novel-to-game/LICENSE.txt\n\n· diagram-design —— 画图表技能（44 种图型，出自包含的 HTML + 内联 SVG），来自 diagram-design v2.6（github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design），以 MIT 授权。\n  本 App 只随包了必需部分（技能正文 + 方法文档 + 五套模板 + 图标）；上游的 211 个示例图与 5 个 python 脚本没有随包（原因写在技能正文的署名区块里）。\n  许可全文随包提供：assets/skills/diagram-design/LICENSE.txt\n\n· Android 运行时自带的系统组件（按 Android 系统许可）。\n· DeepSeek Harness 及各 dsh-* 子包（按各自许可）。': 'This App bundles the following third-party components:\n\n· ffmpeg 7.1 (with libx264) — used by the narration/short-drama page to concatenate, transcode, mix audio and add subtitles. Licensed under GPLv2 or later (GPLv2+) because libx264 (GPL) is enabled.\n  Full license: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\n  Corresponding source: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and https://code.videolan.org/videolan/x264\n  This App has not modified its source; it only compiled it for Android arm64 (build arguments ship with the repository at install/build-ffmpeg-android.sh).\n\n· frontend-design and discernment-nudge — two bundled “skills” (process notes the model reads), taken from Anthropic\'s open-source skills repository (github.com/anthropics/skills) under Apache-2.0.\n  This App modified their text: translated into Chinese and rewritten for this phone\'s execution environment (there is no python here, and steps from the original such as “review screenshots” were removed).\n  The full license ships inside the package: assets/skills/frontend-design/LICENSE.txt and assets/skills/discernment-nudge/LICENSE.txt\n  Full license link: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n\n· novel-to-game / novel-game-analyze / game-concept / game-world-design / game-art-direction / game-build / game-qa (seven bundled skills) — from NovelToGame v0.4.0 (zenstory.ai\'s evidence-grounded novel-to-game workflow), MIT licensed.\n  This App changed only two things: the descriptions were rewritten as one line of Chinese, and an attribution note was added at the top of each body; the bodies and reference files are unchanged.\n  Full license ships inside the package: assets/skills/novel-to-game/LICENSE.txt\n\n· diagram-design — the diagram skill (44 diagram types, self-contained HTML + inline SVG), from diagram-design v2.6 (github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design), MIT licensed.\n  Only the required parts are bundled (SKILL.md + references/ + five templates + icons); the 211 upstream example diagrams and the 5 python scripts are not bundled (why: see the attribution block in the skill body).\n  Full license ships inside the package: assets/skills/diagram-design/LICENSE.txt\n\n· System components included with the Android runtime (under the Android system license).\n· DeepSeek Harness and the various dsh-* sub-packages (under their respective licenses).',
