  '本地模型的上下文不够：这一轮要 {0} tokens，但只给了 {1}。\n下一步：打开「设置 → 本地大模型（测试）」，在「本地模型服务」里把上下文调大一档（推荐 16k），再重新启动服务。': 'Not enough context for the local model: this turn needs {0} tokens but only {1} were available.\nNext: open Settings → On-device model (testing), raise the context by one step under "On-device model service" (16k recommended), then restart the service.',
