  '本机**不能**自动截 WebView 的图（Android 上它是平台视图，截出来常常是空白），所以这里由你玩过之后逐项勾选 —— 这份记录就是证据。': 'This device **cannot** screenshot the WebView automatically (on Android it is a platform view and captures usually come out blank), so you tick the items after playing — this record is the evidence.',
