  '本机模型不在这里 —— 本地模型只做简单对话，且它的入口已撤下，暂时没有界面能进入它。': 'On-device models are not listed here — they are for simple chat only, and their entry point was removed; there is currently no way to open it from the UI.',
  '本机模型不能进轮换池 —— 它只在你手机上跑，轮换池是给云端模型排队用的。': 'On-device models can\'t join a rotation pool — they only run on your phone, and a pool is for queueing cloud models.',
  '本机模型不需要 API Key —— 如果看到这条，说明 App 注入本机凭据时出了问题（这是个 bug，请在「运行日志」里反馈这条消息）。': 'On-device models do not need an API key. If you see this, the App failed to inject the local credential — that is a bug; please report this line from the run log.',
