  '本机离线配音失败：{0}': 'On-device dubbing failed: {0}',
  '本机离线配音的引擎没能加载（{0}）。可能是安装包不完整，或这台机器的架构不受支持 —— 可以改用系统 / MiMo / MiniMax。': 'The on-device dubbing engine failed to load ({0}). The installation may be incomplete, or this device\'s CPU architecture is unsupported — you can switch to System / MiMo / MiniMax.',
  '本机离线配音的模型**已经装好**了（占约 32 MB，离线可用）。': 'The on-device dubbing model is **installed** (about 32 MB on disk, works offline).',
  '本机离线配音的模型还没装好（{0}）。到「配音 → 本机离线」点一下下载即可。': 'The offline dubbing model is not installed yet ({0}). Tap download under "Dubbing → On-device" to install it.',
  '本机离线配音的模型还没装（缺 {0}）。在「配音 → 本机离线」那里点下载即可（31.5 MB，装好后离线可用、不用 Key）。': 'The on-device dubbing model is not installed (missing {0}). Tap download under "Dubbing → On-device" (31.5 MB; offline and key-free once installed).',
  '本机离线配音（2026-10-13 新增，随包）\n\n· sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 —— 本机离线配音的推理引擎（语音合成）。以 Apache-2.0 授权，https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n  源码与文档：https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx\n  本 App 未修改其源码，直接用官方发布的 arm64 预编译库。\n\n· onnxruntime —— sherpa-onnx 的推理后端（随包的 libonnxruntime.so）。以 MIT 授权，源码：https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime\n\n· seek-bzip 2.0.0 —— 纯 JS 的 bzip2 解压（用来在手机上解模型压缩包，因为 Android 既没有 tar 也没有 bzip2）。以 MIT 授权，源码**原样**随包提供：assets/toolbox/vendor/seek-bzip/（含 LICENSE）\n\n· 语音模型 vits-icefall-zh-aishell3 —— **不随包**，由你在 App 里按需下载（约 32 MB）。它来自 icefall（Apache-2.0）（https://github.com/k2-fsa/icefall），基于 aishell3 数据集训练。下载前界面上会写明体积与来源。': 'On-device offline dubbing (added 2026-10-13, bundled)\n\n· sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 — the inference engine for on-device dubbing (speech synthesis). Licensed under Apache-2.0, https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n  Source & docs: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx\n  This app does not modify its source; it uses the official prebuilt arm64 libraries.\n\n· onnxruntime — the inference backend sherpa-onnx uses (the bundled libonnxruntime.so). Licensed under MIT, source: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime\n\n· seek-bzip 2.0.0 — pure-JS bzip2 decompression (used to unpack the model archive on the phone, because Android ships neither tar nor bzip2). Licensed under MIT; its source is bundled **unmodified**: assets/toolbox/vendor/seek-bzip/ (LICENSE included)\n\n· Speech model vits-icefall-zh-aishell3 — **not bundled**; you download it in the app on demand (about 32 MB). It comes from icefall (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/k2-fsa/icefall), trained on the aishell3 dataset. The app shows the size and source before downloading.',
