  '模型文件只是"权重"（一堆数字），真正算的是引擎。这一版随包的是 **LiteRT-LM**（跑 Gemma 4 那批 `.litertlm`）。其它格式（比如 `.gguf` 的 llama.cpp）**没有**编进包里，所以那些模型会显示「缺引擎」。缺引擎不是你的手机不行，是包里没有那个引擎；引擎一上，红就会变绿。': 'A model file is just "weights" (a pile of numbers); the engine does the actual work. This build ships **LiteRT-LM** (for the Gemma 4 `.litertlm` files). Other formats (e.g. llama.cpp `.gguf`) are **not** compiled into the package, so those models show "engine missing". That is not your phone\'s fault — the engine simply is not in the package; once it is, red turns green.',
