  '现在一个模型都没有，开始会话也没法回话。\n\n去「设置 → 模型」：选一家服务商（端点会自动填好），填上你的 API Key，点「测试并保存」。通过之后回到首页就能开始了。': 'There are no models at all right now, so starting a session has nothing to answer with.\n\nGo to Settings → Models: pick a provider (the endpoint is filled in for you), enter your API Key, and tap "Test and save". Once it passes, come back to the home screen and you\'re set.',
  '现在用你填的这一条。清空后保存就回到内置的两条源。': 'Using the source you entered. Clear it and save to go back to the two built-in sources.',
  '现在用内置的两条源（GitHub 原站为主、jsDelivr 兜底），**一般不用动**。如果这两条在你那边连不上，把你自己的镜像地址填进来。': 'Using the two built-in sources (GitHub raw first, jsDelivr as fallback) — **normally you don\'t need to change this**. If neither works on your network, enter your own mirror address.',
  '现在还不能"看图"': 'Image input is not wired up yet',
  '现在这个模型属于「{0}」，但那一家的 API Key 还没配，所以调不通。\n下一步：打开「设置 → 模型」，把这一家的 Key 填上（Agnes 可以到 platform.agnes-ai.cn 免费注册拿 Key），保存后回到会话重发一次。': 'This model belongs to "{0}", but that provider\'s API Key isn\'t set up yet, so calls fail.\nNext: open "Settings → Models" and enter the Key for this provider (you can register free at platform.agnes-ai.cn to get an Agnes Key); save, then go back to the session and send again.',
  '生图': 'Image',
  '生图/生视频经常遇到 429（限流）或排队时，多一把 Key 就能在被限流时**自动换另一把**继续。注意：限流按**账号**算 —— **同一个账号**多建几把 Key 共享同一份配额，加了也没用，必须是**另一个账号**的 Key。': 'When image/video generation often hits 429 (rate limit) or queuing, an extra Key lets it **automatically switch to another** Key while rate-limited. Note: rate limits are per **account** — several Keys under the **same account** share one quota, so adding them won\'t help; it must be a Key from **another account**.',
