  '用 code-tool 技能帮我写一个小工具并跑通。需求：\n（说清输入是什么、要输出什么；我会写成 node 脚本、真的执行一次、把结果给你）': 'Use the code-tool skill to write me a small tool and get it running. What I need:\n(say what goes in and what should come out; I will write a node script, actually run it once, and hand you the result)',
  '用 data-analysis 技能帮我分析数据。数据文件在：\n（把文件路径或工作区文件名写在这里；我要看结论、关键数字和图表）': 'Use the data-analysis skill to analyse my data. The file is at:\n(put the file path or the workspace filename here; I want the findings, the key numbers and charts)',
  '用 diagram-design 技能，': 'Using the diagram-design skill, ',
  '用 doc-digest 技能帮我速读这份长文：\n（给出文件路径或粘贴内容；我要要点清单和一条时间线）': 'Use the doc-digest skill to skim this long piece:\n(give me the file path or paste the text; I want a list of key points and a timeline)',
  '用 doc-processing 技能帮我处理这份文档：\n（写清文件路径与你要的结果：摘要、改写、纠错，还是转成 Markdown/HTML）': 'Use the doc-processing skill to process this document:\n(state the file path and the result you want: a summary, a rewrite, proofreading, or conversion to Markdown/HTML)',
  '用 file-organize 技能帮我整理工作区文件。目标：\n（说明按什么规则重命名或归档；动手前我会先把计划列给你确认）': 'Use the file-organize skill to tidy up the workspace files. What I want:\n(say what rule to rename or archive by; I will show you the plan for confirmation before touching anything)',
  '用 make-image 技能帮我生成一张图片。画面描述：\n（写清主体、场景、风格、光线；我会直接生成图片文件并告诉你路径）': 'Use the make-image skill to generate an image. What it should show:\n(spell out the subject, scene, style and lighting; I will generate the image file directly and tell you its path)',
  '用 make-slides 技能帮我做一份幻灯片。': 'Use the make-slides skill to make me a presentation. ',
  '用 make-slides 技能帮我做一份幻灯片。主题/材料：\n（把主题或要讲的内容写在这里，我先按你说的整理大纲，再生成 .pptx 文件并告诉你路径）': 'Use the make-slides skill to build me a slide deck. Topic/materials:\n(write the topic or the content you want covered here; I will organise an outline first, then generate the .pptx file and tell you its path)',
  '用 make-video 技能帮我生成一段视频。画面描述：\n（写清主体、动作、镜头、时长；我会提交任务并等它生成好，然后给你文件路径）': 'Use the make-video skill to generate a video. What it should show:\n(describe the subject, motion, camera and duration; I will submit the job, wait for it to finish, then give you the file path)',
  '用 novel-to-game 技能把我这本小说做成一个能玩的游戏：\n（给出小说文件路径或书名。我会先拆原著、再比选方向，然后一步步做出能真跑的网页游戏 —— 这是一条多轮流水线，不是一轮就能交付的）': 'Use the novel-to-game skill to turn my novel into a playable game:\n(give me the novel\'s file path or its title. I will deconstruct the source first, compare directions, then build a web game that actually runs — this is a multi-turn pipeline, not a one-shot delivery)',
  '用 sheet-cleanup 技能帮我整理这张表：\n（给出 CSV 路径；说明要去重、统一格式，还是要按某列分组汇总）': 'Use the sheet-cleanup skill to tidy this table:\n(give me the CSV path; say whether you want duplicates removed, formats unified, or a grouped summary by some column)',
  '用 study-cards 技能把这些材料变成学习卡片：\n（给出文件路径或主题；我要「问题 / 答案」成对的卡片，能直接背）': 'Use the study-cards skill to turn these materials into study cards:\n(give me the file path or a topic; I want paired question/answer cards you can memorise directly)',
  '用 translate-polish 技能帮我翻译并润色：\n（给出原文或文件路径，说明目标语言与语气；我要双语对照版）': 'Use the translate-polish skill to translate and polish:\n(give me the source text or the file path, and say the target language and tone; I will give you a side-by-side bilingual version)',
  '用 weekly-report 技能帮我写一份周报。时间范围与关注点：\n（比如"这周做的三件事"；我会先看工作区里的文件再汇总，不确定的地方会问你）': 'Use the weekly-report skill to write me a weekly report. The period and what to focus on:\n(e.g. "the three things I did this week"; I will read the workspace files first and ask you about anything unclear)',
  '用其它应用打开': 'Open with another app',
  '用周围像素把它盖住 —— **不是恢复原内容**。纯色、平滑背景效果好；复杂纹理背景会看出痕迹。': 'It covers the area with surrounding pixels — **it does not restore what was underneath**. Great on flat, smooth backgrounds; visible smudges on busy textures.',
