  '真实行为（本地轮换代理）：按池子里的顺序依次尝试，只有上游失败（429 限流 / 5xx / 连不上 / 等响应头等到超时）才换下一个 —— 流式响应一旦开始下发就不再切换（HTTP 响应头已经发出去，这是协议本身的约束，不是偷懒）；全部成员都失败，才会把错误抛回会话。它还会记住每个池子"上次成功"的那个成员，下次先从它开始试。': 'Actual behaviour (local rotation proxy): members are tried in pool order, and it only moves on when the upstream fails (429 rate limit / 5xx / can\'t connect / timed out waiting for response headers) — once a streaming response starts, it can\'t switch any more (the HTTP headers are already out; that\'s a protocol constraint, not laziness). Only when every member fails is the error returned to the session. It also remembers each pool\'s "last good" member and starts from it next time.',
