  '规则：① 只以你的角色身份说话，**不要出戏**、不要解释自己是 AI、不要总结或复述我的问题；② 每次回复短一点（2-3 句），把行动的余地留给我；③ **不要替我决定**、不要替我写台词；④ 我说「结束」时，给出这个角色的结局（一两句，说清发生了什么）。': 'Rules: ① Speak only as your character — **stay in character**, don\'t explain that you are an AI, don\'t summarise or repeat my question; ② keep each reply short (2-3 sentences) and leave me room to act; ③ **never decide for me** and don\'t write my lines; ④ when I say "end", give this character\'s ending (one or two sentences saying what happened).',
