  '视频模型': 'Video model',
  '视频请求的形状同样按各家文档写：豆包 Seedance（方舟异步任务）/ MiniMax / 通义万相（百炼异步）/ 硅基流动 各一套 —— **能不能通要试**；失败会把上游原话显示出来。': 'The video request shape also follows each vendor\'s docs: one set each for Doubao Seedance (Ark async job) / MiniMax / Tongyi Wanxiang (Bailian async) / SiliconFlow — **whether it works has to be tried**; failures show the upstream\'s own wording.',
  '角色三视图专家': 'Character sheet expert',
  '角色现在是**打字**的：本机还没有「朗读回复」（语音合成在「创作台 → 口播/短剧」那条线上，不在会话里）——想让角色出声要另做一层，已列入后续。': 'For now characters **type**: this device has no read-aloud replies yet (speech synthesis lives on the Studio → Voice-over / Short drama line, not inside a session) — giving a character a voice needs another layer, and that is on the list.',
