  '让 App 能安装 APK（例如以后把新版本安装包交给它来升级）。每次安装系统还会再问你一次。': 'Lets the app install APKs (e.g. hand it a newer build to upgrade). The system still asks you again for each install.',
  '让 App 能读写手机里任意目录的文件（不只是自己那一份）。不开也能用：会话与工具会在自己的私有目录、以及你手动选给它的范围内活动。': 'Lets the app read and write files anywhere on the phone (not just its own folder). It works without this: sessions and tools stay inside the app\'s private folder plus whatever you hand them through the file picker.',
  '让 DSH 写一份文档或生成一张图，产物会出现在这里。': 'Ask DSH to write a document or generate an image — the result shows up here.',
  '让「短剧剧本专家」写一版': 'Let the short-drama writer draft one',
  '让会话能用子智能体': 'Sub-agents',
  '让会话能联网搜索': 'Let sessions search the web',
  '让模型**演一个角色**，你跟他打交道 —— 每张牌都写清了「谁演谁、在哪、你要办成什么、什么时候算完」。**这不是聊天**：聊天没有压力、没有后果、也没法结束。': 'Have the model **play a character** you deal with — every card spells out who plays whom, where it happens, what you have to achieve, and when it\'s over. **This is not chat**: chat has no pressure, no consequences, and no way to end.',
  '让模型**长期记住**你的事（身份、偏好、项目事实、禁忌）：可以自己写，也可以从最近的会话里**自动提炼**候选、由你确认。它写进 AGENTS.md，DSH 在**每个新会话的第一个请求前**注入模型上下文；**对已经打开的会话不生效**，要新建会话。': 'Let the model **remember your things long-term** (identity, preferences, project facts, taboos): write them yourself, or **auto-extract** candidates from a recent session and confirm them. They go into AGENTS.md, and DSH injects them into the model context **before the first request of every new session**; **they do not apply to sessions already open** — start a new one.',
  '让模型演一个角色，你跟他打交道 —— 每局都有目标和结束条件': 'Have the model play a character you deal with — every round has a goal and an ending condition',
  '让模型记住这些（关闭后不再注入）': 'Let the model remember these (turn off to stop injecting)',
  '让模型读一段真实对话，提炼出长期有效的偏好与事实。**提炼结果不会自动写入**，要你勾选确认；每次提炼都会真实调用一次模型（会花额度）。': 'Have the model read a real conversation and extract lasting preferences and facts. **Extracted results are not written automatically** — you tick what to keep; every extraction really calls the model once (it uses quota).',
