  '说明：装进来之后，在下面点「建索引」，这一包才会被检索。建好索引的包，在「本地对话」里提问时会**自动查** —— 把最相关的几段资料（每包最多 2 段、总共最多 3 段）一起发给模型。⚠️ 查到不等于模型一定照它回答；资料没命中时，一句都不会发出去。': 'Note: after a pack is installed, tap "Build index" below — only then can it be searched. Indexed packs are **searched automatically** when you ask something in Local chat: the most relevant passages (at most 2 per pack, 3 in total) are sent to the model along with your question. ⚠️ Finding a passage doesn\'t mean the model will follow it; if nothing matches, not a single passage is sent.',
