  '运行环境（约 32 MB）不在这个安装包里 —— 那样每次更新都要重下它。改成**第一次打开时下这一次**，支持断点续传；下完在本机解开（约 26000 个文件）。这一步只做一次，以后更新不用再下。': 'The runtime (~32 MB) is not inside this installer — that keeps every update from re-downloading it. Instead it is downloaded **once, on first open** (resumable), then unpacked on the device (~26,000 files). This happens once; later updates do not repeat it.',
