  '这 5 项不是普通权限：Android 不允许应用自己开，也没有「应用内开关」—— 只能在系统的「特殊应用权限」页里拨。下面写清每一项是干嘛的。': 'These 5 are not ordinary permissions: Android does not let an app grant them to itself, and there is no in-app switch — you can only flip them in the system\'s "Special app access" page. Below is what each one is for.',
