  '这三个就是设置里那几个模型（文本模型 = 首页新会话用的那个；图形/视频 = 「设置 → 图像 / 视频模型」），在这儿改等于在设置里改 —— 创作台生成时会**直接用**这里选的。': 'These are the same models as in Settings (text model = the one new chats use; image/video = Settings → Image / Video models). Changing them here is the same as changing them there — the studio will use exactly these when generating.',
  '这不像一个完整网址：要以 http:// 或 https:// 开头。': 'That does not look like a complete URL: it must start with http:// or https://.',
  '这两颗按钮跟手机档次无关 —— 同一份模型，只是换「谁来算」：CPU 是通用的，慢一点但稳；GPU 用图形芯片加速，通常快好几倍，但**部分机型在长对话时会把引擎干崩**（真机上遇到过，崩了就会报连不上）。所以默认给了 CPU；想快就切 GPU 试 —— 万一崩，下次启动会自动换回 CPU。': 'These two buttons have nothing to do with the phone tier — same model, you just choose who computes: CPU is universal, a bit slower but stable; GPU uses the graphics chip and is usually several times faster, but **on some devices it crashes the engine during long chats** (seen on real devices — after a crash you only get connection errors). So CPU is the default; switch to GPU if you want speed — if it crashes, the next start automatically falls back to CPU.',
  '这个 Android 版本不需要': 'Not needed on this Android version',
  '这个包与当前应用的**签名不一致**，不能覆盖安装 —— 它可能不是同一个来源发的。如果你确实换了签名钥匙，唯一的办法是卸载重装（数据会丢）。': 'This package’s **signature does not match** this app, so it cannot be installed over it — it may not come from the same source. If you really did change signing keys, the only way is to uninstall and reinstall (your data will be lost).',
