  '这个模型在该端点上不存在。请点「获取模型」重新选。': 'This model doesn\'t exist on that endpoint. Tap "Fetch models" to choose again.',
  '这个模型文件只带 {0} 格缓存，上下文已收敛到 {0} 格（你设的是 {1}）—— 它的上下文上限就是那么多，装不下更长的对话': 'This model file carries only {0} cache slots, so the context was narrowed to {0} (you had set {1}) — that is its hard ceiling, and longer conversations will not fit.',
  '这个模型没有在 DSH 的路由里注册。\n下一步：回「设置 → 模型」把默认模型重新点一次（这会让 App 重写配置），或者到会话里用模型按钮重新选一次。': 'This model isn\'t registered in DSH\'s routing.\nNext: go back to Settings → Models and tap the default model once more (this makes the app rewrite the config), or re-select it with the model button in the session.',
  '这个模型没法在当前会话里直接切，正在重建会话…': 'This model can\'t be switched directly in the current session. Rebuilding the session…',
  '这个模型的对话缓存装不下了：它的上下文上限是 {0} token，当前这段对话已经接近上限。请点右上角新开一个会话，或换一个上下文更大的模型。': 'This model\'s conversation cache is full: its context ceiling is {0} tokens and this conversation is already near it. Tap the top-right to start a new session, or switch to a model with a larger context.',
  '这个池子一个成员都没有 —— 在模型面板里选中它会直接失败，建议放进一两个模型或删掉它。': 'This pool has no members at all — selecting it in the model panel will just fail; add one or two models or delete it.',
  '这个池子里的模型所在厂家都还没配 API Key —— 现在选中它，发言时必然失败。去「设置 → 模型 → 我的模型」给其中至少一家填 Key。': 'None of the providers behind this pool has an API Key configured yet — selecting it now will always fail when you speak. Go to Settings → Models → My models and set a Key for at least one of them.',
  '这个账号下没有可用的系统音色。': 'This account has no usable system voices.',
  '这些是什么意思？': 'What do these mean?',
  '这些说明是随 App 版本一起发出来的文字记录（离线存在安装包里）；App 不会联网检查新版本，也不会提示你升级。': 'These notes ship with the app version (stored offline inside the package). The app doesn\'t check online for new versions and won\'t prompt you to upgrade.',
  '这份日志是为了让开发者看出"运行中哪里出错了"。它会包含：': 'This log helps developers see "what went wrong at runtime". It includes:',
  '这份是本地缓存的公告，还没有和远端对上时间': 'This is the locally cached notice list; it has not been matched against the remote yet.',
  '这会删掉所有记忆条目，并从 AGENTS.md 里移除它们。不可恢复。': 'This deletes every memory entry and removes them from AGENTS.md. It can\'t be undone.',
  '这台手机没有可接收分享的应用（系统返回 {0}）。': 'This phone has no app that can receive the share (system returned {0}).',
  '这台手机没有可用的「保存文件」界面（系统返回 {0}）。': 'This phone has no "Save file" screen available (system returned {0}).',
  '这台手机没有可用的「文字转语音」引擎（系统里一个都没装）。两条路：① 到「系统设置 → 语言与输入 → 文字转语音」装一个引擎并下载中文语音包；② 改用 MiMo 或 MiniMax 配音 —— 在「设置 → 云端大模型 → MiMo / MiniMax」里填一个 API Key 即可。': 'This phone has no usable text-to-speech engine (none is installed). Two routes: ① install one via system settings → Languages & input → Text-to-speech, and download Chinese voice data; ② use MiMo or MiniMax instead — just add an API key under Settings → Cloud models → MiMo / MiniMax.',
  '这台手机没有语音引擎？改用 MiMo（需 Key）': 'No speech engine on this phone? Switch to MiMo (needs a key)',
  '这台手机没装中文语音数据。请到「系统设置 → 语言与输入 → 文字转语音」里下载中文语音包；或者改用 MiMo 配音（需要 Key）。': 'Chinese voice data is not installed. Download it in System settings → Languages & input → Text-to-speech, or switch to MiMo voice (needs a Key).',
  '这台手机（或这个 Android 版本）里没有「{0}」的设置页 —— 国产 ROM 常把入口改名、藏起来或整个删掉。手动找：{1}': 'This phone (or this Android version) has no system page for "{0}" — Chinese ROMs often rename, hide or remove it. Open it manually: {1}',
  '这台设备上找不到能处理安装的应用（一般是定制系统裁掉了安装器），装不了。': 'No app on this device can handle the installation (custom ROMs sometimes strip the installer), so it cannot be installed.',
  '这台设备上没有可以提炼的会话。': 'There is no session on this device to extract from.',
  '这台设备上没有可用的语音识别服务': 'No speech recognition service is available on this device',
  '这台设备没有能打开网页的应用，请手动访问：{0}': 'This device has no app that can open web pages. Please visit manually: {0}',
  '这台设备没有能接收分享的应用': 'This device has no app that can receive the share',
  '这台设备的名字': 'This device\'s name',
  '这家在本 App 里没接图像：点上面的「换一个」选一家支持图像的厂家。': 'This vendor\'s image API is not wired up in this app: tap \'Change\' above to pick a vendor that supports images.',
  '这家在本 App 里没接视频：点上面的「换一个」选一家支持视频的厂家（Agnes / 豆包 Seedance / MiniMax / 通义万相 / 硅基流动）。': 'This vendor\'s video API is not wired up in this app: tap \'Change\' above to pick a vendor that supports video (Agnes / Doubao Seedance / MiniMax / Tongyi Wanxiang / SiliconFlow).',
  '这家没有内置的注册地址 —— 去它的官网申请 Key 就行。': 'This provider has no built-in sign-up link — just get a Key from its official website.',
  '这家还没配 Key': 'This provider has no Key yet',
  '这就是当前那把主 Key，不用再加一遍': 'That\'s the current primary Key — no need to add it again',
  '这张图打不开（Flutter 解码失败）：{0}\n\n{1}': 'This image can\'t be opened (Flutter decode failed): {0}\n\n{1}',
  '这张图读不到了（可能刚被删除或移动），换一张试试。': 'This image can no longer be read (it may just have been deleted or moved). Try another one.',
  '这把 Key 已经在列表里了': 'That Key is already in the list',
  '这是什么': 'What this is',
  '这是按消息长度**估算**的（ACP 目前不把真实用量推给 App），只看趋势别看小数。\n换窗三步：① 生成交接笔记 → ② 发出去 → ③ 新建一个会话继续。': 'This is **estimated** from message length (ACP doesn\'t push real usage to the app yet) — read the trend, not the decimals.\nThree steps to a fresh window: ① generate a handover note → ② send it → ③ start a new session and continue.',
  '这条会话在磁盘上没有可回放的消息。': 'This session has no replayable messages on disk.',
  '这条会话没能恢复': 'This session couldn\'t be restored',
  '这条会话的记录没读出来 —— 会话文件可能已经不在了。你可以换一条，或者自己手写一条。': 'This session\'s record could not be read — the session file may be gone. Pick another session, or write one yourself.',
  '这条会话里没有可提炼的对话内容（没有用户或助手的消息）。': 'This session has no conversation content to extract from (no user or assistant messages).',
  '这条回答顶到了长度上限、被截断了（不是答完）。可以再发一句「继续」，或者把问题拆小一点再问。': 'This reply hit the length limit and was cut off (it didn\'t finish). Send "continue", or split your question into smaller ones.',
  '这条是好的。': 'This one is fine.',
  '这条模型的清单里没有 sha256，而清单要求必须校验哈希，已拒绝安装：{0}': 'This model has no sha256 in the manifest, but the manifest requires hash verification — install refused: {0}',
  '这条没能发出去：会话没能建起来，可以再试一次。': 'This message wasn\'t sent: the session couldn\'t be created. Please try again.',
  '这条没能回上来。可以再发一次；若反复如此，去「设置 → 运行日志」看细节。': 'This one did not come back. Try sending it again; if it keeps happening, check Settings → Run log for details.',
  '这条通道现在是通的，不用填 Key。模型清单随时会变，以「获取模型」拉到的那份为准。': 'This channel is working right now, with no key needed. The model list changes at any time — trust what “Fetch models” returns.',
  '这条通道用不了的时候才需要它：点一次自检，它会告诉你到底是哪种问题（网络不通 / 被上游拒绝 / 模型名退役 / Key 失效 / 限流），并可以把结论一键发给开发者。': 'Only needed when this channel stops working: run the self-check once and it tells you which kind of problem it is (no network / rejected by upstream / model name retired / invalid key / rate limited), and you can send the findings to the developer in one tap.',
  '这次下的是**完整包**（含运行环境）—— 因为这台手机上还没有，这样装完就能直接打开、不需要联网再补。': 'This download is the **full package** (runtime included) — this device does not have it yet, so the app can be opened right after installing, with no further download.',
  '这次下的是**精简包**（不含运行环境）—— 这台手机上已经有了，所以能省下那份流量。': 'This download is the **lite package** (no runtime) — this device already has it, so that data is saved.',
  '这次不提示': 'Don\'t remind me',
  '这次创作台用哪三个模型': 'Which three models should the studio use?',
  '这次没有提炼出值得长期记住的内容 —— 这不代表失败，只是这段对话里没有跨会话有用的事实。你也可以自己手写一条。': 'Nothing worth remembering long-term came out of this one — that is not a failure, it just means this conversation had no facts useful across sessions. You can also write one yourself.',
  '这次用哪三个模型': 'Which three models for this run',
  '这段会话的上下文已经用掉约 {0}（估算）。用「长会话助手」可以把关键信息跟着带到新窗口，接着聊不会断。': 'This session has used about {0} of its context (estimate). The long-session assistant can carry the key points into a new window so the conversation continues without a break.',
  '这段话就是引擎的原话，没加工 —— 发我这份就能直接定位。': 'This is the raw message from the engine, unedited — send it over and I can pinpoint the cause.',
  '这版引擎没编 Vulkan，只有 CPU 后端': 'This engine build has no Vulkan — CPU backend only',
  '这类错误通常过一会儿重试就好。': 'This kind of error usually goes away if you retry in a moment.',
  '这里写的话会进 AGENTS.md，DSH 在**每个新会话的第一个请求前**把它注入模型上下文 —— 与「专家」开关同一条通道。**对已经打开的会话不生效**，要新建一个会话。': 'What you write here goes into AGENTS.md, and DSH injects it into the model context **before the first request of every new session** — the same channel the Experts toggle uses. **It does not affect sessions that are already open** — start a new one.',
  '这里只显示你在「专家」页打开开关的专家；它们的角色摘要已写入下面这个文件，DSH 会在新会话的第一个请求前注入模型上下文。': 'Only experts you switched on in the Experts page are shown here; their role digests are written to the file below, and DSH injects them into the model context before the first request of a new session.',
  '这里汇集了**所有生成过的图片和视频**：「影视」页生成的、以及会话里生成的一起收在这里，不用记是谁生成的。': 'This gathers **every image and video you have generated** — whether from the Studio page or from a chat — so you don\'t have to remember which one made it.',
  '这里汇集了所有生成过的图片和视频': 'Everything you have generated shows up here',
