  '连不上': 'cannot connect',
  '连不上模型端点。\n可能是：手机网络不通、Base URL 写错，或者你在用「轮换组」而本地代理没起来（回设置页切一下模型就会重新起）；如果你用的是本机模型，多半是引擎刚崩了或被系统回收了 —— 去「设置 → 本地大模型（测试）」重新点一次「启动」。改完重发一次即可。': 'Can\'t reach the model endpoint.\nPossible causes: no mobile network, a wrong Base URL, or you\'re using a rotation pool while its local proxy isn\'t running (switching models on the settings page restarts it). If you\'re using an on-device model, the engine probably just crashed or was reclaimed by the system — open Settings → On-device model (testing) and tap "Start" again. Fix it and send your message once more.',
